---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="work — aqib raza" description="What I've built and where I've worked.">
  <div class="max-w-[65ch] mx-auto px-8 py-20">

    <h1 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-10 tracking-wide">work</h1>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-[#2C2A27] leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1.05rem;">

      <!-- pr0ject zero -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">pr0ject zero</h2>
          <span class="text-sm text-[#6B6760]">2026 -- present</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#6B6760] text-sm mb-3">this site</p>
        <p>
          Built aqib.fyi from scratch with zero technical knowledge. No prior experience with web development, version control, or deployment. Learned what was needed to make each piece work. The site is a real thing that exists now.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#6B6760]">
          Stack: Astro, Tailwind CSS, Vercel. Domain on Porkbun.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- KraftedX -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">KraftedX</h2>
          <span class="text-sm text-[#6B6760]">June 2024 -- present</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#6B6760] text-sm mb-3">Founder's Office Executive -- content and creative agency, Delhi</p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium mb-1">Recruitment</p>
            <p>Built the recruitment function from scratch when there was no infrastructure. Placed 29 people over ~10 months: engineers, content creators, designers, operations, and interns. Wrote all job descriptions, assignment briefs, and interview guides. Managed the full candidate lifecycle end-to-end.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="font-medium mb-1">MyContentos</p>
            <p>Co-built a ClickUp-based content operations product with the CTO. Designed the full system architecture, defined scope, set up automations, wrote all documentation. Pitched to an enterprise client's co-founders and secured buy-in. Migrated a 20+ person team onto the system. Served as the sole external point of contact post-launch.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="font-medium mb-1">Scout</p>
            <p>Helped launch a creative talent placement service from pilot to live. Ran all supply-side operations: sourcing, screening, scheduling, candidate prep. Contributed to the pivot from product to service model based on customer discovery.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="font-medium mb-1">Operations and systems</p>
            <p>Built the company's internal CRM, recruitment pipeline tracker, and two BD CRMs. Built 10+ ClickUp workflows used by a 30-person team managing 500+ content pieces a month. Wrote the company handbook. Researched Indian labour law and drafted a new leave policy that was implemented company-wide.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- KRG -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">KRG Strategy Consultants</h2>
          <span class="text-sm text-[#6B6760]">April -- May 2023</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#6B6760] text-sm mb-3">Business Analyst Intern -- remote</p>
        <p>
          Primary market research on skill gaps in India. Investment research for a VC. Financial ratio analysis and macroeconomic write-ups.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Education -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">Education</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-2">
          BBA, Financial Investment Analysis -- Shaheed Sukhdev College of Business Studies (SSCBS), Delhi University. 2022--2025.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6760]">
          Notable work: DCF valuation of Godrej Properties, equity research on DMart, research papers on CCI antitrust enforcement and Make in India.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Skills -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium mb-4">Skills</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[#6B6760] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-2">Strong</p>
            <p>Full-cycle recruitment. Operations and systems building. Enterprise product implementation. Client and stakeholder management. Working in zero-structure, high-ambiguity environments. Building functions from scratch with no playbook.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-[#6B6760] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-2">Decent</p>
            <p>Market and competitor research. Customer discovery. Automation setup. Cold outreach. Pricing and resource planning. Long-form writing.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-[#6B6760] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-2">Foundational</p>
            <p>Financial modelling. VC/PE frameworks. Equity research. Econometrics basics.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Resume -->
      <div class="pt-2">
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6760]">
          Resume available on request -- <a href="mailto:aqib7raza@gmail.com" class="text-[#8B5E14] hover:underline">aqib7raza@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>